  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4971c5eb32d68c6419c2b82ec69e3fa3, type: 3}
  m_Name: ErraticeMouseMovementOne
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NarratorEventData
  eventID: ErraticMouseMovementOne
  dialogueLines:
  - "The player seems to be trying to look at everything at once. They\u2019re going
    to get dizzy."
  - The player is moving their view rather enthusiastically. Perhaps they should
    slow down.
  - "The player appears to be looking everywhere except where they\u2019re going.
    This can\u2019t end well."
  - The player is turning around rather quickly. Even the narrator is struggling
    to keep up.
  - The player seems determined to inspect the entire room in one second. Maybe take
    it easy.
  - "The player\u2019s view is moving rather erratically. Perhaps they should give
    their mouse a rest."
  - "The player is looking left, right, up, and down all at once. Surely this isn\u2019t
    necessary."
  - The player appears to have discovered how quickly they can turn. The narrator
    is not impressed.
  - "The player is spinning their view around like they\u2019re searching for something.
    Hopefully they don\u2019t make themselves dizzy."
  - The player is looking around at an alarming speed. Perhaps slowing down would
    be wise.
  canRepeat: 1
  priority: 1
